# Examples

## Project with artifacts:
```
# Compiled and build artifacts
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.o
*.obj
dist/
build/
target/

# Dependencies
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.julia/
.zig-cache/

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*.swo

# Environment
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/
.coverage

# Package manager caches
.gradle/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
```

## Minimal changes:
```
src/main.py
README.md
config.json
```

## With build artifacts:
```
app.py
dist/bundle.js
node_modules/lodash/index.js
.pytest_cache/v/cache.db
```

## Image files (do not ignore):
```
logo.png
screenshot.jpg
icon.gif
```